{"3199180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Steel Swarm: APOCALYPSE", "steam_appid": 3199180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>- ONLY A USERNAME IS NEEDED FOR ACCOUNT CREATION; NO OTHER INFO IS REQUIRED -</i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Move Swiftly, Strike Vigorously</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You command a mighty <strong>Xalium Battle Tank (XBT)</strong> with WASD controls. Click to move is possible too, but swift positioning is vital because XBTs take more damage from the sides and even more from the back. That makes positioning key to landing your shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In fact, you must aim well with every shot, because <strong>every shot is a skill shot!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battlefield of Swarms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/e5ee36e89d677f45744488d9c254c889.poster.avif?t=1757573482\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/e5ee36e89d677f45744488d9c254c889.webm?t=1757573482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/e5ee36e89d677f45744488d9c254c889.mp4?t=1757573482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>100+ minions per team, per avenue, per minute</strong>, the battlefield is teeming with thousands. Whether you are obliterating minions in clusters, swarming heroes, or overwhelming turrets, once you adapt to this new scale of war, no other MOBA will compare. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mission Dictates the Plan</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/dada5670ddace35db3e7013a5e407717.poster.avif?t=1757573482\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/dada5670ddace35db3e7013a5e407717.webm?t=1757573482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/dada5670ddace35db3e7013a5e407717.mp4?t=1757573482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger and riches abound in the streets of Rotnor. The city is divided into two halves, each with four neighborhoods inhabited by neutral factions: police, military, pirates, and Xorm. Decide who to <strong>ally </strong>with, <strong>undertake missions</strong> for them, and secure vital <strong>upgrades </strong>that can shift the balance of power. Once you’re strong enough, rally your team to challenge <strong>mighty Mantis</strong>, the rogue XBT, for a reward that could change the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Commander</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/71dad59c784029f4c8b3b99ef23006aa.poster.avif?t=1757573482\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/71dad59c784029f4c8b3b99ef23006aa.webm?t=1757573482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/71dad59c784029f4c8b3b99ef23006aa.mp4?t=1757573482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select the battle tank and pilot that align with your team role from an ever-growing pool of options. Every five levels, enhance your skills with <strong>modifications</strong>. Acquire <strong>upgrades </strong>and <strong>gears </strong>to tailor your tank to your distinctive playing style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Obstacle is a Road</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/6d814ed71a89da0de70ebb1347d89ab9.poster.avif?t=1757573482\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/6d814ed71a89da0de70ebb1347d89ab9.webm?t=1757573482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/6d814ed71a89da0de70ebb1347d89ab9.mp4?t=1757573482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have the <strong>power to destroy anything</strong> in your path. Create new routes between lanes through the jungle, ambush enemies from behind, or surprise them with backdoor attacks just when they think they’ve won.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stop the APOCALYPSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gear up, Commander!</strong> The swarm is relentless, the city is yours to reshape, and victory demands <strong>TRUE SKILL</strong>. Assemble your team, strategize your build, and carve your path through the chaos to stop the Apocalypse!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>- ONLY A USERNAME IS NEEDED FOR ACCOUNT CREATION; NO OTHER INFO IS REQUIRED -</i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Move Swiftly, Strike Vigorously</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You command a mighty <strong>Xalium Battle Tank (XBT)</strong> with WASD controls. Click to move is possible too, but swift positioning is vital because XBTs take more damage from the sides and even more from the back. That makes positioning key to landing your shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In fact, you must aim well with every shot, because <strong>every shot is a skill shot!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battlefield of Swarms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/e5ee36e89d677f45744488d9c254c889.poster.avif?t=1757573482\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/e5ee36e89d677f45744488d9c254c889.webm?t=1757573482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/e5ee36e89d677f45744488d9c254c889.mp4?t=1757573482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>100+ minions per team, per avenue, per minute</strong>, the battlefield is teeming with thousands. Whether you are obliterating minions in clusters, swarming heroes, or overwhelming turrets, once you adapt to this new scale of war, no other MOBA will compare. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mission Dictates the Plan</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/dada5670ddace35db3e7013a5e407717.poster.avif?t=1757573482\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/dada5670ddace35db3e7013a5e407717.webm?t=1757573482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/dada5670ddace35db3e7013a5e407717.mp4?t=1757573482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger and riches abound in the streets of Rotnor. The city is divided into two halves, each with four neighborhoods inhabited by neutral factions: police, military, pirates, and Xorm. Decide who to <strong>ally </strong>with, <strong>undertake missions</strong> for them, and secure vital <strong>upgrades </strong>that can shift the balance of power. Once you’re strong enough, rally your team to challenge <strong>mighty Mantis</strong>, the rogue XBT, for a reward that could change the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Commander</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/71dad59c784029f4c8b3b99ef23006aa.poster.avif?t=1757573482\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/71dad59c784029f4c8b3b99ef23006aa.webm?t=1757573482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/71dad59c784029f4c8b3b99ef23006aa.mp4?t=1757573482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select the battle tank and pilot that align with your team role from an ever-growing pool of options. Every five levels, enhance your skills with <strong>modifications</strong>. Acquire <strong>upgrades </strong>and <strong>gears </strong>to tailor your tank to your distinctive playing style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Obstacle is a Road</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/6d814ed71a89da0de70ebb1347d89ab9.poster.avif?t=1757573482\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/6d814ed71a89da0de70ebb1347d89ab9.webm?t=1757573482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/6d814ed71a89da0de70ebb1347d89ab9.mp4?t=1757573482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have the <strong>power to destroy anything</strong> in your path. Create new routes between lanes through the jungle, ambush enemies from behind, or surprise them with backdoor attacks just when they think they’ve won.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stop the APOCALYPSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gear up, Commander!</strong> The swarm is relentless, the city is yours to reshape, and victory demands <strong>TRUE SKILL</strong>. Assemble your team, strategize your build, and carve your path through the chaos to stop the Apocalypse!</p>", "short_description": "SSA is a 5v5 twin-stick shooter MOBA with vehicular combat in a fully destructible city. Fight huge swarms, complete missions, and blast through buildings to ambush your enemies. Positioning matters and every shot is a skill shot!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/7f658b2da24abb7ce73738a08e33450f10b44740/header.jpg?t=1757573482", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/586a735a57afb3c796a0c1d24f225120acc49092/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757573482", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180